  "closes": "Provides the RFC 6962 Merkle-tree alternative baseline for amphora-run-provenance provenance auditing, with verified O(log n) inclusion + consistency proofs over the genuine runtime leaves and fail-closed tamper detection; quantifies the audit-scaling gap versus the shipped linear chain.",
