    "all_pass": true
  },
  "hypothesis": "Over the identical leaf set the RFC 6962 Merkle tree yields O(log n) inclusion proofs and O(log n) append-only consistency proofs that reconstruct the tree roots exactly and fail closed under any single-leaf tamper, whereas the shipped linear chain requires O(n) suffix reveal for the same audit.",
